== pglogical: e-w1 -> e-w2, PostgreSQL 18 ==

-- latency: 1000 single-row transactions, one session, 50 ms apart
p50 0.2 ms, p95 0.6 ms, p99 1.4 ms, rows 1000

-- throughput: pgbench, 8 clients, 30 s, one insert per transaction
   source: tps = 96650.480984 (without initial connection time)
   source committed 2899850 rows; 2863446 were on the target when the load stopped; the rest took 0.3 s more
   target applied 95704 rows/s over the whole run, 95448 rows/s while it was loaded

-- one transaction of 1,000,000 rows
   committed on the source after 1.0 s, complete on the target 3.3 s after that
